          <change when="2014-11-06T08:14:09.233-05:00" who="https://papyri.info/editor/users/simoeis">Vote - AcceptText - Ln9 is fine.  Ln13 already recorded a diaeresis, also in Bell's edition (I find it, however, more difficult to see than that in line 9; there rather seems to be a stray dot).  Other corrections are good, although the omicron before upsilon in τοιοῦτο in line 16 is hard to make out. </change>
