          <change when="2014-08-12T03:55:37.077-04:00" who="https://papyri.info/editor/users/berkes.lajos">I've added diaireseis in lin. 9 and 13 and three minor corrections to lin 16 and 20. The corrections are based on the digital image available online. I've also inserted the Coptic docket as it was described in the ed pr.</change>
